  "about": "Tested A/B impulse pairs for the T5 Oscillator dice. Every pair was rendered in the built standalone on Stable Audio 3 Medium (tonal slot), linear injection, at nine A/B positions from -1 to +1 and on two seeds, and passed: complete render, every note sounding, no clipping, no collapse, and the slider changing the sound. The ', c3' suffix puts the generated pitch on C. Tags describe each prompt on three axes: time = how the sound unfolds, material = what is vibrating, source = what makes it. A missing tag means no value on that axis fits.",
